{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-categorical-laplace-q-heat-resolvent","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:categorical-laplace-q-heat-resolvent","kind":"remark","title":"The categorical Laplace transform and the $q$-heat resolvent","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-laplace","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-q-heat-equation","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-q-resolvent"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-laplace","tags":["hopf-algebra","laplace","q-heat","resolvent"],"text":"categorical-laplace-q-heat-resolvent.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"rem:categorical-laplace-q-heat-resolvent\"></a>\n<strong>Remark.</strong> <em>The categorical Laplace transform and the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-heat resolvent</em></p>\n<p>The Laplace transform converts the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-heat equation into the spectral equation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">s \\hat{u}(s) - u_0 = -\\widehat{\\Delta_q} \\hat{u}(s)</code>. This yields the resolvent of the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-Laplacian, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\hat{u}(s) = (s + \\widehat{\\Delta_q})^{-1} u_0</code>.</p>\n"}
